  {
   "name": "THE FRONTIER (`frontier_two_sided`): the explicit mixture `(1-b)*w_proxy + b*w_cert` lands inside `[9b/(128(4+2rM)), b/(8rM)]` at every sacrifice `b`, so the two-sided law is exhibited and not only proved",
